<title>USA: BFGoodrich Co Q3 net higher.</title>
<headline>BFGoodrich Co Q3 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>ARKON, Ohio 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.19		    $0.59</p>
<p> Net			 64,600		   32,900</p>
<p> Revs		     677,000		  606,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	54,300		   52,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$2.27		    $1.71</p>
<p> Net			122,400		   94,800</p>
<p> Revs		   1,927,600		1,800,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	53,800		   52,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 periods include gain of $30 million,</p>
<p>or $0.55 a share, from income from discontinued</p>
<p>operations.</p>
<p>Q3 oper share: $0.64 vs $0.59.</p>
<p>First Call consensus Q3 earnings estimate: $0.63 a share.</p>
